From 532995bb51ca05735164ed57912befcc50c3988d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 13:46:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3279/5749] fix(model-fallback): align OpenAI fallback
 resolution across CLI and runtime

Keep install-time and runtime model tables in sync, stop OpenAI-only misrouting when OpenCode Go is present, and add valid OpenAI fallbacks for atlas, metis, and sisyphus-junior.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
